From k274: ensure_base64_f uses the backend's timeout; Net::Async::HTTP has none by default, so a hanging image host stalls the request forever. Apply a per-fetch timeout (30s like sync, or engine-configurable) via Future timeout (IO::Async loop->timeout_future) on the async path. Test with a local daemon that never answers.
